    {
      "text": "Council report 2025-11-18: applicant Greystar in partnership with property owner Metropolitan Life; site at the southeast corner of El Camino Real and Castro Street with a vacant restaurant and an operating Chase bank. Final Supplemental EIR (SCH 2023050251) certified. Community benefit contribution $5,045,161.74; park land in-lieu fee $3,582,920 for 266 net new units.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002414",
        "SRC-002415"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Council reports 2026-11-17: after a legal dispute with Metropolitan Life, a proposed settlement extends the zoning permits to four years from the November 18, 2025 approval (building permits and construction by November 18, 2029) and ties the community benefit payment to the first residential foundation, excavation or structure permit.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002415",
        "SRC-002416"
      ]
    }
